    "text": "Remember the guy who tried to kill a spider with a blowtorch and burned his house down? (The correct answer is: Which one? Yes, it’s happened multiple times.) That will be today’s theme.\nOur most urgent task after the midterms is to create a list of everyone who supported the Iran War so we’ll know who to never, ever, ever, ever trust again. Pending a full accounting, here are the top two: Benjamin Netanyahu, prime minister of Israel, and Rupert Murdoch—still alive as of this writing—patriarch of Fox News and the New York Post.\nRead Full Article: https://www.lewrockwell.com/2026/11/no_author/who-gave-us-this-disastrous-war/",
